// A `DeedAgent` with NEITHER arm ([CR#702.11d,702.16b]): the two-armed agent
// constrains through `stack_object` and/or `source`; an empty agent is
// spellable but meaningless. (Omitting `by` entirely yields the shroud
// default — any spell or ability — which is fine.)
Normal(
  name: "Reject Empty Deed Agent",
  types: [Creature],
  abilities: [
    Static(Cant(Target(on: Ref(This), by: ()))),
  ],
  power: 1,
  toughness: 1,
)
